    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": "<div>Grading The final grade will be determined by the following weights: Class Discussion and Participation (15%) TEST 1 (5%) Midterm Exam. (30%) Midterm Report &amp; Presentation (10%): Portfolio construction. Final Exam. (20%) Final Report &amp; Presentation (20%): Selected topics are related to Investments.</div>\n",
    "tpa_score_new_en": "<div>Grading The final grade will be determined by the following weights: Class Discussion and Participation (15%) TEST 1 (5%) TEST 2 (5%) Midterm Exam. (30%) Midterm Report &amp; Presentation (15%): Portfolio construction. Final Exam. (20%) Final Report &amp; Presentation (10%): Selected topics are related to Investments.</div>\n",
    "course_pol": "(1)所有學生在課堂上都應尊重每個人，並且在任何時候都應以合理、負責和禮貌的態度行事。\n(2)上課時請勿講話、閱讀、睡覺或做其他非本課程相關作業，除分組進行討論外，否則應盡量減少邊際對話。",
    "course_pol_en": "Kindly demonstrate mutual respect for one another by refraining from unnecessary conversations or disruptive noise while in class, unless it is related to class interactions. Additionally, please avoid engaging in any behavior that could potentially hinder the learning experience of your fellow students. \nRemember that a respectful and cooperative atmosphere enhances the overall educational journey and allows each student to maximize their learning potential.\nTo ensure a productive learning environment, it's important to attend classes punctually and submit assignments by their designated deadlines.",
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": "The related course information will be announced on ilearn.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>學習必須以誠信為基礎，任何學生企圖將自己未製作的作品，作為自己的作品，此行為是為不誠實行為。在作業、測驗或考試中作弊或抄襲的學生或協助他人的行為，該次成績以零分計，若是累犯，將依逢甲大學學生獎懲辦法提送。<br />\n考核時如果您抄襲他人的答案、或交作業時您交出全部或部分由他人撰寫的論文或作業，則被視為作弊。<br />\n考核時如果您抄襲他人的答案、或交作業時您交出全部或部分由他人撰寫的論文或作業，則被視為作弊。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Students are required to uphold the fundamental principles of academic integrity, place a strong emphasis on academic ethics, and take active measures to prevent instances of cheating or plagiarism.</div>\n\n<div>In the event that a student is found to have engaged in cheating or plagiarism, the consequences are serious. Examinations and final reports that involve such misconduct will be assigned a grade of zero.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
